ause()) {","+            if (cause instanceof HttpException http) {","+                return \"HTTP %d: %s\".formatted(http.statusCode(), http.getMessage());","+            }","+            if (isBodilessErrorResponse(cause)) {","+                return \"The HTTP response had no body, which is what a proxy refusing the connection returns (for example 407 Proxy Authentication Required). \"","+                    + \"Check the JVM proxy credentials (http(s).proxyUser and http(s).proxyPassword) and that the JVM is started with -Djdk.http.auth.tunneling.disabledSchemes= .\";","+            }","+        }","+        return failure.getMessage();","+    }","+","+    // langchain4j reads the body of an error response without a null check, and the JDK gives none to a refused CONNECT: the status is lost in a NullPointerException.","+    private static boolean isBodilessErrorResponse(final Throwable cause) {","+        StackTraceElement[] stackTrace = cause.getStackTrace();","+        return cause instanceof NullPointerException && stackTrace.length > 0 && JDK_HTTP_CLIENT.equals(stackTrace[0].getClassName());","+    }","+}"],"additions":32,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"webserver/src/main/java/io/kestra/webserver/services/ai/anthropic/AnthropicAiService.java","lines":["@@ -1,7 +1,5 @@"," package io.kestra.webserver.services.ai.anthropic;"," ","-import java.io.ByteArrayInputStream;","-import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;"," import java.util.List;"," "," import io.kestra.core.docs.JsonSchemaGenerator;","@@ -13,10 +11,7 @@"," import io.kestra.webserver.services.ai.AiService;"," import io.kestra.webserver.services.ai.NamespaceContextTool;"," import io.kestra.webserver.services.posthog.PosthogService;","-import io.kestra.webserver.utils.HttpClientUtils;"," ","-import dev.langchain4j.http.client.HttpClientBuilderLoader;","-import dev.langchain4j.http.client.jdk.JdkHttpClientBuilder;"," import dev.langchain4j.model.anthropic.AnthropicChatModel;"," import dev.langcha